      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokora kw’obosooku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teebia Abaisraeli ng’a nateebire iga: Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa gokora buna abanto ba Misiri bagokora, agwo ase mwamenyete, gose buna abanto ba Kaanani bagokora, ense eyio nkobaira mochie komenya, gose timobaisa kobwatia chingencho chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moigwere amachiiko aane, na mokore aya nkobachika. Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, mokore aya nkobachika, na mobwate amachiiko aane. Omonto karakore amang’ana ayio nabe moyo. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Monto onde bwensi tabaisa koraara n’omokuungu ore omoamate omwabo. Okwo nokorentera omoamate omwabo obosooku. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara na nyoko. Okwo nokomorentera iso obosooku. Torentera nyoko obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara na nyoko moke, moga iso. Okwo nokomorentera iso obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara na moiseke omino, omoiseke o iso gose oyo o nyoko, onye moiboire komo ase enyomba eyemo, gose oiboire ase enyomba ende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara nomochokoro oo, oyo bw’omwana oo omomura, gose oyo bw’omwana oo omosubati. Ayio nigo arakorentere obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara nomoiseke o nyoko moke, moga iso; oyio nomoiseke omino iso aiborete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara nomoiseke omwabo iso; oyio nyoko moke, omwabo iso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara nomoiseke omwabo nyoko; oyio nyoko moke, omwabo nyoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara na moga iso moke omwabo iso; okwo nokorentera iso moke obosooku, ekiagera omokungu oyio nyoko moke are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara na moka momura oo; obwo nobosooku, ekiagera n’omokuungu bw’omwana oo omomura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara na moka momura omino; okwo nokomorentera momura omino obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara nomoiseke bw’omokuungu kwabeire nere, gose tobaisa gotwara omochokoro oye, omoiseke bw’omwana oye omosubati, gose oyo bw’omomura oye, ekiagera abwo nabaanto abamo. Obwo nobonyaka obobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koira mokoyoo, omwabo mokao, ekero mokao are moyo; ayio nabaise korenta obobisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa koraara n’omokuungu ekero abwate omotienyi, ekiagera ere tachenegeti ase ekero ekio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara n’omokuungu bw’omosaacha onde na gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa korua omwana onde oo abe ekeng’wanso ase enyasae Moleki, ekiagera okwo nokorentera erieta ria Nyasae oo obosooku. Inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara nomonto omosacha buna okoraara n’omokuungu; obwo nobonyaka obobe bw’okogechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa koraara neng’iti ende yonsi na gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka nero. Na omokungu tabaisa kwerua koraara neng’iti ende yonsi. Obwo nobonyaka obobe kegima bw’okogechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inwe timobaisa gwekora abatachenegeti ase ogokora buna okwo. Ase enchera eyio abanto b’ebisaku mbesoetie ase ogotacheneka, na bono inche Omonene nkobaseria inde baabatigere inwe ense eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogokora kwabo gokarentera ense eria ogotacheneka, na inche nkayea egesusuro ase engencho y’ogosaria okwo, na ense eyio ekaanga tiyatwara abanto bamenyeteo, korende ekabaseria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo inwe mwensi, ababiare gose abamenyi bamenyete ase egati yaino, goika morende amachiiko aane na kobwata aya onsi nabachiikire, gose timobaisa gokora kende gionsi gi’okogechia okwo abanto b’ebisaku bakorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bamenyete ase ense eria ritang’ani riaino nigo bakorete okogechia okwo gwonsi, na igo ense eria ekaba etachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moise gokora ayio, ense eyio nigo erabaange morue aroro, buna yangete abanto b’ebisaku, abwo baabatang’anerete komenyao,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera monto onde bwensi orakore okogechia konde gwonsi buna okwo, oyio naatananwe korwa ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, moigwere amang’ana aya onsi nabachiikire, na moyakore. Timobaisi kwenaria chingencho chi’okogechia chiakoretwe nabaanto abwo baabatang’anerete komenya ase ense eyio. Moise gokora igo, inamwesoyie ase ogotacheneka ase chingencho echio. Inche ninche Omonene, Nyasae oino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
